& [InputContract] is exact
  + [bytes] are one exact caller-supplied successful returned region
  + [maximum_entries] is 1 through 1024
  + [maximum_name_utf16_units] is 1 through 32767
  + [minimum_nonempty_region] is one 24-byte header plus one UTF-16 code unit
  = must: reject invalid limits, empty or undersized regions, and every malformed chain before releasing output

& [EntryContract] is structural
  + [header_size] is 24
  + [endianness] is little endian
  + [next_offset] zero terminates; nonzero is at least header plus name, divisible by eight, forward-progressing, and within the region
  + [name_length] is positive even bytes and within the caller unit limit
  + [sizes] are nonnegative signed inputs released as u64
  + [name] decodes strict UTF-16LE without replacement or NUL termination
  + [grammar] is exactly ::$DATA or :nonempty:$DATA
  + [terminal] final header plus name ends exactly at region length
  + [padding] between name end and nonterminal next offset is ignored

& [OutputContract] is inspectable
  + [records] retain source order, exact decoded names, sizes, allocation sizes, and source byte offsets
  + [fault] exposes one closed code and bounded deterministic detail
  + [sorting] is absent
  + [uniqueness] is absent
  + [default_stream_count] is absent
  + [named_stream_admission] is absent
  + [entry_kind_policy] is absent
  - never: output query success, physical completeness, same-handle origin, trust, freshness, filesystem support, admission, or receipt facts

& [ImplementationBoundary] is zero effect
  + [authorized_file] is crates/cantor_ecosystem/src/windows_stream_info_parser.rs
  + [authorized_export] is the exact library-module export
  + [authorized_tests] are focused parser, strict serialization, static pointer-free no-effect, evidence, and workspace regression tests
  + [Cargo_delta] is zero
  + [lockfile_delta] is zero
  + [unsafe] is zero
  + [pointer_cast_or_dereference] is zero
  - never: import windows-sys or use filesystem, handle, process, environment, clock, network, persistence, model, traversal, content, admission, receipt, mutation, seal, or promotion APIs

& [RequirementSet] is M2B-SIP-001 through M2B-SIP-013
  + [parser_requirements] are strict limits, exact region, little-endian headers, checked offsets, alignment, lengths, strict UTF-16, grammar, nonnegative sizes, terminal exhaustion, source order, ignored padding, closed faults, and zero effects
  + [correction_requirements] are historical supersession and unchanged-implementation revalidation

& [AcceptanceContract] is exact
  + [source] both manifests match exact bytes and SHA-256
  + [focused] eight parser tests and one independent static test pass in debug and overflow-checked release
  + [module] SHA-256 remains A4C968AFA570827C0A9E61B2B2DEFABF55E4EBD9EAABBD180E91794F69A2E732
  + [effects] Cargo, lockfile, dependency, pointer, unsafe, and runtime-effect deltas remain zero
  + [evidence] manifest names the replacement signature and rehashes current artifacts
  + [global] workspace debug and release tests, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, and audit pass
  + [dependency_gate] supplied entry-observation assembly remains unprocessed until this acceptance is recorded

& [AuthorityBoundary] is replacement and revalidation only
  + [allowed] unchanged pure parser module, export, tests, evidence, solution, proof, review, narrative, and dependent-parser citation after revalidation
  + [forbidden] production behavior change, profile change, dependency change, pointer, unsafe, physical query or completeness, Win32, filesystem, stream admission, traversal, receipt, mutation, seal, or promotion

& [SJSProcessingTrace] is complete
  + [source_preserved] is original source and correction source with exact manifests
  + [delineated] is pure parsing versus acquisition, provenance, admission, and downstream effects
  + [exploded] is thirteen requirements, thirteen constraints, thirteen failures, and ten verification gates
  + [semantically_refined] is successful-region, complete-vector, raw-record, and valid-signature meaning
  + [constraint_checked] is source, external structure context, framework protocol, artifact guard, and byte-identical implementation
  + [pruned] is false protocol authority, retroactive authorization, semantic drift, padding overinterpretation, and physical overclaim
