  + [seven_fold_phase_locked] is subject, terms, data, relations, constraints, failures, and proof convergence
  + [justified] is truthful supersession with support, confidence, counterargument, residual risk, invalidation, and rollback
  + [planned] is ordered preservation, processing, signing, revalidation, evidence, proof, and publication
